  "text_md": "\u00188 Los Alamos National Laboratory\n  <tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n  <tr>\n</table>\n  <tr>\n</table>\n</table>\n    <td>![](<081875a1035e34dee439b9a2a3a55e319405_page_20_pg1_images/imageFile4.png>)<br><br>Blowout panels and other debris are scattered up to \u001800 ft away from building \u001840 after a \u0018\u0018-lb test shot.</td>\n<table>\n<table>",
