        "y0": 0.9366339301179994,
        "x1": 0.34999904781836216,
        "y1": 0.9398589550868452
      },
      "text": "After HE pipes, fixtures, and asbestos were removed, instrumentation was attached to the exterior and interior of building \u001840 before a test.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
