        "x0": 0.15340884676454591,
        "y0": 0.2485790982093369,
        "x1": 0.5175212524890741,
        "y1": 0.3737093502235224
      },
      "text": "the tests and to assess the buildings’ structural response. The hydrocodes CTH, a Sandia National Laboratories code, and AUTODYN, a commercial code, provided the basis for modeling.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
